<title>USA: Mesirow Financial buys Chicago real estate company.</title>
<headline>Mesirow Financial buys Chicago real estate company.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mesirow Financial said on Monday it acquired Stein &amp; Co, a Chicago-based real estate company. Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Mesirow provides private equity, securities brokerage, asset management, insurance services, investment banking and real estate services.</p>
<p>Stein has nearly 120 employees in nine offices and offers real estate services including development and management.</p>
<p>		((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
